            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Fully fixes the crash when previewing a video and then moving to another</b> file.<b> 1.5.3 addressed one cause; recent macOS also crashed while</b> reconfiguring the video player's controls as the preview closed. The preview pane now tears down video/audio previews defensively, so switching away from a media file can no longer crash the app. Video playback is unaffected.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
